        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>附录二 可持续发展相关风险和机遇 - 美的集团2024 ESG报告</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0 60px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .top-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 25px 0 15px 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .top-header .left {\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .top-header .nav {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 22px;\n  }\n  .top-header .nav span { white-space: nowrap; }\n  .top-header .nav .active {\n    border: 1px solid #1f9de0;\n    color: #1f9de0;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n  }\n  h1.section-title {\n    color: #1f9de0;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 25px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .legend-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #444;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .legend-bar .period {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n  }\n  .legend-icon {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #fff;\n  }\n  .legend-icon.short { background: #f4a35a; }\n  .legend-icon.mid { background: #3fa9e5; }\n  .legend-icon.long { background: #5cc27a; }\n\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 50px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .column {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .icon-circle {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 2px solid;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .icon-circle.short { border-color: #f4a35a; color: #f4a35a; }\n  .icon-circle.mid { border-color: #3fa9e5; color: #3fa9e5; }\n  .icon-circle.long { border-color: #5cc27a; color: #5cc27a; }\n\n  /* LEFT COLUMN: icon -- text box -- label box */\n  .column.left .icon-circle { margin-right: -17px; }\n  .column.left .text-box {\n    flex: 1;\n    border: 1px solid #3fa9e5;\n    border-radius: 6px 0 0 6px;\n    padding: 12px 18px 12px 26px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #333;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .column.left .label-box {\n    width: 130px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    background: #1f9de0;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* RIGHT COLUMN: label box -- text box -- icon */\n  .column.right .label-box {\n    width: 130px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    background: #1f9de0;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    border-radius: 6px 0 0 6px;\n  }\n  .column.right .text-box {\n    flex: 1;\n    border: 1px solid #3fa9e5;\n    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\n    padding: 12px 26px 12px 18px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #333;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .column.right .icon-circle { margin-left: -17px; }\n\n  .footnote {\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #999;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #666;\n    width: 60%;\n  }\n  .page-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #444;\n    margin: 30px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"top-header\">\n    <div class=\"left\">2024・美的集团ESG报告</div>\n    <div class=\"nav\">\n      <span>关于本报告</span>\n      <span>走进美的</span>\n      <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n      <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n      <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n      <span>践行科技尽善</span>\n      <span>共创繁荣生态</span>\n      <span class=\"active\">附录</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"section-title\">附录二 可持续发展相关风险和机遇</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"legend-bar\">\n    <span>时间周期<sup>24</sup>：</span>\n    <span class=\"period\"><span class=\"legend-icon short\">短</span>短期</span>\n    <span class=\"period\"><span class=\"legend-icon mid\">中</span>中期</span>\n    <span class=\"period\"><span class=\"legend-icon long\">长</span>长期</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"column left\">\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle short\">短</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应建立完善的环保管理体系，加强环境监测和评估，确保生产活动符合相关标准和法规要求，从而降低环境风险和运营成本。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">环境<br>合规管理</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle short\">短</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应尊重员工权益，提供平等的工作机会和福利待遇，建立包容性的企业文化，通过吸引和留住来自不同背景的人才，增强创新能力。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">员工权益与<br>多元化</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle mid\">中</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应建立完善的网络安全防护体系，加强数据管理和监控，确保客户数据的安全和隐私。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">数据安全与<br>客户隐私保护</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle short\">短</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应加强对供应链中冲突矿产的监控和管理，确保采购的矿产来自合法和可持续的来源，避免出现相关事件的负面声誉与财务影响。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">冲突<br>矿产管理</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle mid\">中</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应加强对水资源的管理和监控，采用节水技术和工艺，并通过推动水资源循环利用和节水文化建设，降低水资源消耗、污染和利用成本。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">可持续<br>水资源管理</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle short\">短</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应建立健全的反腐败机制，加强员工教育和培训，确保经营活动的合规性和透明度。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">反商业贿赂及<br>反贪污</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle mid\">中</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业在推广产品或服务时，必须遵循真实、准确、透明的原则，避免夸大其词或误导消费者，从而确保企业正面形象。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">负责任营销与<br>宣传</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">高效利用能源不仅可以降低企业的运营成本，提高生产效率，还有助于减少对环境的影响。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">能源利用</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle mid\">中</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应坚决抵制虚假宣传、恶意降价、商业贿赂等不正当竞争行为，通过合法合规的经营方式，树立行业标杆，推动整个行业的健康发展。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">反不当竞争</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle short\">短</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应严格遵守环保法规，加强污染治理，减少污染物排放，保护生态环境。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">污染物排放</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应积极参与社会公益活动，通过捐赠资金、物资、技术支持等方式回馈社会，帮助弱势群体，促进社会和谐稳定。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">社会贡献</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应强化知识产权保护，维护合法权益，同时尊重他人知识产权，通过完善管理制度激发创新活力，助力技术进步与产业升级。</div>\n        <div class=\"label-box\">知识产权保障</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"column right\">\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">应对气候变化</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">随着全球气候变化的日益严峻，企业可通过采用可再生能源、提高能源利用效率、推广绿色产品和服务等方式，积极应对并减缓气候变化的影响。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">创新与研发</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">通过不断探索新技术、新产品和新服务，企业可以保持竞争优势，满足消费者不断变化的需求。同时，研发投资也可能带来财务投入和潜在风险。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle mid\">中</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">产品质量与<br>安全</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">确保产品符合标准法规，是企业保护消费者的底线。企业需完善质量管理体系，强化检测监控，保障产品质量稳定。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">供应链管理与<br>安全</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">有效的供应链管理可以降低生产成本，供应链的稳定性和可靠性可以防范潜在的风险和中断，企业需要加强供应商管理。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">员工健康与<br>安全</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应提供安全的工作环境，加强员工健康管理和培训，确保员工免受伤害。健康的员工队伍可以提高工作效率和生产力，为企业创造更多价值。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle short\">短</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">循环经济与<br>废弃物管理</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业循环利用资源、减少废弃物产生并妥善处置，既能降低环境负担、提升资源利用效率，又能借循环经济与绿色生产模式开拓新商机与市场空间。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">公司治理</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应完善治理结构与内控机制，保障决策科学透明合规。深化与股东、投资者及利益相关方的沟通协作，夯实信任基础，提升企业形象声誉。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle short\">短</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">员工培训与<br>发展</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">通过提供培训和发展机会，企业可以激发员工潜能，提升其工作效率和生产力，为企业创造更多价值。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle mid\">中</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">消费者体验</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应关注消费者需求，不断精进产品和服务，满足消费者不断变化的需求，提升品牌形象和市场份额。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle short\">短</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">股东权益</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应确保股东利益得到充分保障，通过建立良好的治理结构、透明的信息披露和合理的股利分配机制，深化股东沟通合作，提升投资者信心。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle mid\">中</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">促进行业发展</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应积极参与行业交流与合作，通过分享经验、整合资源、协同合作等方式，共同推动技术创新和产业升级，实现互利共赢。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"label-box\">生物多样性<br>保护</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">企业应积极采取措施，保护生态环境和生物多样性，避免对生态系统造成破坏。</div>\n        <div class=\"icon-circle long\">长</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footnote\">\n    <sup>24</sup> 结合美的集团所处行业、公司的战略规划和运营实际，我们的短中长期定义为：短期（0-1年）；中期（1-5年）；长期（5年以上）。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-footer\">\n    <span>141</span>\n    <span>142</span>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
